{"id":268,"name":"Cascoon","slug":"cascoon","types":["bug"],"generation":3,"region":"Hoenn","favoriteRank":null,"artworkUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/268.png","flavorText":"CASCOON makes its protective cocoon by wrapping its body entirely with a fine silk from its mouth. Once the silk goes around its body, it hardens. This POKéMON prepares for its evolution inside the cocoon.","description":"Cascoon is the Cocoon Pokémon, a Bug-type first discovered in the Hoenn region. It stands 2'04\" (0.7 m) tall and weighs 25.4 lbs (11.5 kg). The silk coating its body is thin but sufficiently strong. Cascoon's silk has a luster and texture superior to that of Silcoon's, and clothes made using Cascoon silk are regarded as top-notch. If it is attacked, Cascoon remains motionless however badly it may be hurt. It does so because if it were to move, its body would be weak upon evolution. This Pokémon will also not forget the pain it endured.","evolution":{"from":{"id":265,"name":"Wurmple"},"to":[{"id":269,"name":"Dustox"}]},"family":{"stages":[[{"id":265,"name":"Wurmple"}],[{"id":266,"name":"Silcoon"},{"id":268,"name":"Cascoon"}],[{"id":267,"name":"Beautifly"},{"id":269,"name":"Dustox"}]],"megas":[]},"cards":[{"rank":1,"cardId":"ex1-26","name":"Cascoon","set":"Ruby & Sapphire","rarity":"Uncommon","imageUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex1/26/high.webp","thumbUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex1/26/low.webp","price":14.11,"currency":"USD","variant":"reverse-holofoil"},{"rank":2,"cardId":"ex12-30","name":"Cascoon","set":"Legend Maker","rarity":"Uncommon","imageUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex12/30/high.webp","thumbUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/ex/ex12/30/low.webp","price":10.82,"currency":"USD","variant":"reverse-holofoil"},{"rank":3,"cardId":"dp1-44","name":"Cascoon","set":"Diamond & Pearl","rarity":"Uncommon","imageUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/dp/dp1/44/high.webp","thumbUrl":"https://